{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Study Buddy 是一款離線優先的學習助手，適閤中小學至大學入門程度的學生使用。它結合人工智能問答、數學運算、語文查閱與學習規劃工具，即使身處飛行模式，只要完成一次知識庫設定，仍可隨時提問、查字與整理功課。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線問答與溫習工具</h2>\n<p>用戶可輸入問題取得適齡答案，也可用語音輸入發問，或把相機對準題目由 OCR 轉成文字查詢，答案引用內置學習資料庫。數學工具涵蓋算式解題、公式代入與圖表計算機，語文方面提供英文字典及同義詞。另設科目管理、筆記與學習計時器，並可透過 QR 碼分享內容。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-190-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-191-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-192-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-193-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-194-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-195-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Study Buddy – School App</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T17:57:50.213427+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}